{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Resolves an ","type":"text"},{"code":"@EnvironmentObject","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in its own ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — a normal, eager render context —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"then hands the already-resolved reference to ","type":"text"},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" by direct reference.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/ReducerEnvironmentCapture\/init(_:content:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/ReducerEnvironmentCapture\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/ReducerEnvironmentCapture\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Statoscope\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Statoscope\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Statoscope\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/ReducerEnvironmentCapture","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ReducerEnvironmentCapture","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Combine16ObservableObjectP","text":"ObservableObject","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"The problem this solves","anchor":"The-problem-this-solves"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI detaches lazily-evaluated presentation content — a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationLink"},{"type":"text","text":" destination,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".navigationDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":".sheet","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":".fullScreenCover","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":".popover","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and similar — from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enclosing view hierarchy for environment-propagation purposes. An "},{"code":"@EnvironmentObject","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"injected between the presenting view’s ancestor and the presentation call site is NOT"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visible inside that lazy closure: resolving "},{"code":"@EnvironmentObject","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" there crashes with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“No ObservableObject of type X found.” This isn’t specific to any one presentation API —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it’s the same failure for all of them, because the root cause (lazy evaluation detaching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the closure’s rendering context) is the same."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Resolving the environment object here, in a normal (non-lazy) ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and passing the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already-resolved value into ","type":"text"},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" by direct reference sidesteps the lookup entirely —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing inside ","type":"text"},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ever needs to resolve ","type":"text"},{"code":"@EnvironmentObject","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" itself, no matter how"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"lazily SwiftUI evaluates it."}]},{"text":"Where this alone is NOT enough","anchor":"Where-this-alone-is-NOT-enough","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Owning the presentation control (rendering as an eager sibling, never nested inside a lazy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"closure) is necessary but confirmed (device-tested, multi-level real app) not sufficient on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its own: "},{"code":".navigationDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"code":"NavigationLink","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" push results are anchored to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"NavigationStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"code":"NavigationView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" container’s own position, not to wherever the pushing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"content is currently nested. An "},{"code":"@EnvironmentObject","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" resolved here is only reachable if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"ReducerEnvironmentCapture","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" itself renders no deeper than that container — true for a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single level of push navigation, false a few levels down. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"_ReducerChildViewConnector"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"built on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReducerRegistryCapture"},{"type":"text","text":" instead, which sidesteps this by resolving from a single"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"root-injected "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReducerStoreRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than resolving "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"S"},{"type":"text","text":" itself via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@EnvironmentObject"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at whatever depth this renders — see "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReducerStoreRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":" for why that’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"depth-independent. Kept as a public primitive for single-level cases and any other custom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use; prefer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReducerRegistryCapture"},{"type":"text","text":" for anything that might be reached through more than one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level of push navigation."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/statoscope\/reducerenvironmentcapture"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ReducerEnvironmentCapture"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ReducerEnvironmentCapture","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:10Statoscope25ReducerEnvironmentCaptureV","modules":[{"name":"Statoscope"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"ReducerEnvironmentCapture"},"references":{"doc://Statoscope/documentation/Statoscope":{"title":"Statoscope","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A lightweight library for managing state in iOS applications, designed with simplicity, testabili